guide forever/reputation/gnomeregan-exiles
title Gnomeregan Exiles Reputation
category Reputation
faction Alliance
levels 12-60
zone Ironforge
# Built from the Era-baseline reference data: Bubulo Acerbus, the Gnomeregan Exiles
# cloth quartermaster, and the cloth quests 7807/7808/7809/7811 (one-time) and 7812
# (Additional Runecloth, repeatable) from quests.json; cloth farm spots are
# the densest spawn clusters of strong cloth droppers in items.json/npcs.json.
# Nothing public shows Forever changing the cloth donations; this has NOT been
# play-tested on Forever yet. Refine it with Polestar_Recorder sessions.
#
# The client never flags a repeatable quest as completed, so the Additional
# Runecloth steps finish on the Gnomeregan Exiles standing (rep 54); each
# step's optional `turnin 7812 direct` checks off at its first hand-in. Cloth counts (60 per first donation, 20 per repeat) are game
# knowledge: the data only has the 60 Runecloth of A Donation of Runecloth.

step Bubulo Acerbus: A Donation of Wool
  tip Bubulo Acerbus takes cloth for Gnomeregan Exiles in Tinker Town, Ironforge. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  level 12
  accept 7807

step Wool Cloth
  zone Westfall
  tip Riverpaw Bandits and Taskmasters (level 16-18) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7807.1 @59.9,70.7

step Bubulo Acerbus: A Donation of Silk
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 7807
  level 26
  accept 7808

step Silk Cloth
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Syndicate Mercenaries at Stromgarde (level 31-32) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7808.1 @32.3,28.3

step Bubulo Acerbus: A Donation of Mageweave
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 7808
  level 40
  accept 7809

step Mageweave Cloth
  zone Tanaris
  tip Dunemaul ogres (level 45-48) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7809.1 @40.1,54.4

step Bubulo Acerbus: A Donation of Runecloth
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 7809
  level 50
  accept 7811

step Runecloth
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) drop it here; every Scourge kill here also counts toward the Argent Dawn (see that guide). The Auction House works too.
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7811.1 @40,51.3

step Bubulo Acerbus: Runecloth delivered
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 7811

step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  tip Additional Runecloth takes 20 Runecloth per turn-in and repeats as often as you like. Bring Runecloth in multiples of 20 and hand them all in at once, one turn-in after another. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7812 direct optional
  rep 54 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  tip Keep handing in Additional Runecloth, 20 Runecloth at a time. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7812 direct optional
  rep 54 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  tip Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Gnomeregan Exiles is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7812 direct optional
  rep 54 Exalted
